JL</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Second-line platinum therapy in patients with ovarian cancer previously treated with cisplatin</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1991</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>389</fpage><lpage>393</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||3|389||bib12|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McHugh</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Spanswick</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hartley</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Repair of DNA interstrand crosslinks: molecular mechanisms and clinical relevance</article-title><source>Lancet Oncol</source><year>2001</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>483</fpage><lpage>490</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet Oncol||2|483||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11905724</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Olive</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Banath</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Durand</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heterogeneity in radiation-induced DNA damage and repair in tumour and normal cells measured using the &#x02018;comet' assay</article-title><source>Radiat Res</source><year>1990</year><volume>122</volume><fpage>86</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Radiat Res||122|86||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2320728</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ozols</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Eifel</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><collab>Ovarian cancer, Fallopian